why=Walks edges forward, from requirer to provider, with the guard mirrored too, so it reports what the changed repo depends on instead of what depends on it.
breaks=impact_correct
file=Mitos/Impl/Impact.lean
find=e.providingRepo == x || seen.contains e.providingRepo
replace=e.requiringRepo == x || seen.contains e.requiringRepo
find=!seen.contains e.requiringRepo
replace=!seen.contains e.providingRepo
find=(e.requiringRepo :: seen)
replace=(e.providingRepo :: seen)
